I like pets.

To use them effectively you need to find a magic whistle.  When you use
it, the pet appears next to you from wherever it is on the level.  To
find a magic whistle, it helps if you name the first ordinary whistle
you find "normal".  Any subsequent ones you find not named normal are
magic.

To get them to move a little faster, you could try zapping them with
a wand of speed monster (Yes, you can also speed yourself by zapping
yourself: "zX.", where X is your wand).

If your pets keep getting killed, once you have the see invisible 
intrinsic, be sure to zap them with a wand of make invisible.
This (combined with speed) will make them last much longer.

Also, getting your pet to walk into a polymorph trap may turn it
into something a lot better (or zap it with a polymorph wand while
you're zapping other things).
